bezierjs
https://github.com/Pomax/bezierjs

Used in: src/bezier/arc_length.cpp (arc length by 24-point Legendre-Gauss
quadrature: Bezier.length and utils.length, with their constants) and
src/bezier/offset.cpp (offsetting curves: Bezier.simple, utils.angle and the
construction of Bezier.scale; splitting at extrema as Bezier.reduce does, then
halving instead of its 0.01 steps), adapted to C++. The error control and the
splitting where the offset folds are not from bezierjs. Also compiled into the
WebAssembly module.

